LC in Trempealeau County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/trempealeau-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025 that same pair came in at 38% of normal, while March to April ran 151% in 2025. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 83% and June to July at 125% on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 29554 had its driest year in 1976 at 53%.</p>"}
